// typography,effects}.css whose value is a colour, a length, a duration, an easing or a number
// (Raw values - shadows, gradients, clip paths, font stacks - are read by name where a style needs
// them). Append-only, in file order. DF.UI.Tokens.NamesMatchDesignSystem fails if a line here has
// no token behind it, or a token in the CSS has no line here.
//
//   DF_UI_TOKEN(CppName, "css-name", Kind)

